	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Search Tide Commander from Alfred.

Keywords:
  tc  [query]  — agents, areas and buildings. Enter focuses the agent in any open Tide Commander UI; Cmd+Enter opens it in the browser; Alt+Enter copies the agent id. Empty query lists the most recently active agents.
  tcs [query]  — full-text search across every agent conversation (claude, grok, codex, opencode, pi). Enter focuses the agent that holds the conversation.

Configure the Server URL and API token in the workflow configuration.</string>
